        "raw": "![Arcane Wonders box|587x500](upload://480IrQxnPHEsrpedCNmdbKMpwrW.jpeg)\nSo I went down to check the mail today because I had a package.\n\nWas it my family's medical supplies that typically come in this big a box? No, it was the *board game* I kickstarted.\n\nMy mom's walker for scale, I guess? Jesus this thing is huge. It's as heavy as it is big, too.\n\nIronically I can't give you an unboxing because we're currently having construction done, so my shelves are currently taken up by all the stuff that would normally be on the moved furniture, so I have nowhere to put the contents of this box.",
